  { q: 'What is an AI dealer in blackjack?', a: 'A digital dealer generated by computer, instead of a person filmed in a studio. Some studios record real dealers with motion capture and turn them into animated “digital clones” streamed in real time. The look is human; the person isn’t there.' },
  { q: 'Are AI dealer blackjack games fair?', a: 'It depends on how the cards are produced, not on who deals them. If an animated dealer “deals” cards picked by a random number generator, the game works like any online RNG blackjack: fair if the operator is licensed and audited, with a fresh shuffle every hand. Play only on licensed sites and read the table rules.' },
